OL,3,AUK inflation hits highest rate in a
OL,4,Ayear, driven by rising fuel prices
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK inflation rate rose again in
OL,7,FOctober, hitting 3.6%
OL,9,FIt's the fourth consecutive monthly
OL,10,Frise, and the highest rate in a year -
OL,11,Fthe Bank of England's target is 2%
OL,13,FThe Office for National Statistics says
OL,14,Fhigher fuel bills were "once again a
OL,15,Fmajor contributor" - but other things
OL,16,Falso increased in price, including
OL,17,Fcomputer software and cat food
OL,19,FThe government says wars in the Middle
OL,20,FEast and Ukraine have "pushed up costs
OL,21,Faround the world"
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
