OL,3,ARubio says US not 'under systemic
OL,4,Aattack' after series of tech outages
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS Secretary of State Marco Rubio has
OL,7,Fdismissed widespread concerns online
OL,8,Fthat the series of recent tech outages
OL,9,Fin the past week are connected, telling
OL,10,Freporters there was "zero evidence" of
OL,11,Fany link.
OL,13,FRubio acknowledged that "people are
OL,14,Ffearful" the spate of outages, which
OL,15,Fincluded all flights being grounded in
OL,16,Fthe US and widespread disruptions to
OL,17,Fbanking, Apple and Microsoft services,
OL,18,Fcould be linked or part of a plot.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
