OL,3,ADemocrats win Alaska Senate race two
OL,4,Aweeks after midterms counting began
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt took two full weeks of counting to
OL,7,Fcall a winner in the 3 November poll
OL,8,Fdue to the logistical challenge of
OL,9,Fcollecting ballots from across the
OL,10,Fstate's remote expanse.
OL,12,FThe Democratic win is the ninth Senate
OL,13,Fseat the party took from Republicans in
OL,14,Fthis year's midterms, giving the party
OL,15,Fcontrol of the US Congress for the last
OL,16,Ftwo years of Donald Trump's presidency.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
